nderstanding. - Do not take off your wristband under any circumstances and do not lose your ticket. - The event includes visual effects that are not suitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy. - Your ticket and the wristband given to by the event gives the right to enter the event area in designated hours. If you lose your wristband and/or ticket or take off your wristband you will lose the right to attend the event. The organizer will not be responsible for lost tickets and/or wristbands. - During the event, please keep your phones away from the show lights which use lasers and other lighting effects.","description":"100% Music Presents: BRITPOP LEGEND SUEDE, JULY 17, 2026 AT ZORLU PSM! Suede, who launched the golden age of Britpop and shaped an entire generation's aesthetic, musical, and emotional codes, is returning to Istanbul after all these years! The band is redefining the modern alternative rock scene with their new album, “Antidepressants.” The Turkish stop on this album tour will take place on Friday evening, July 17, 2026, at the Turkcell Stage, organized by Epifoni and Zorlu PSM. Suede, who opened the doors to the Britpop movement in the early 1990s, not only changed the musical atmosphere of the era; the band's theatrical stage language, dark lyricism, and unique British sound inspired countless groups worldwide. Spanning from glam rock to art rock, their expansive sonic world and Brett Anderson's unique stage persona elevated Suede beyond just a band—they became the emotional memory of an entire generation. Still striking, still innovative, and still breathtakingly powerful on stage after a career spanning over 30 years, Suede draws listeners into a new atmosphere with their tenth studio album, “Antidepressants.” The band will perform the new tracks from this album live for the first time in Istanbul. Legendary songs etched into Britpop history, such as Trash, Animal Nitrate, Beautiful Ones, So Young, and many more, will resonate once again at Zorlu PSM.","classifications":[{"genre":{"id":"KnvZfZ7vAeA","name":"Rock"},"family":false,"segment":{"id":"KZFzniwnSyZfZ7v7nJ","name":"Music"},"subGenre":{"id":"KZazBEonSMnZfZ7v6dt","name":"Alternative Rock"}}]}	2026-07-15 18:02:58.514499	2026-07-15 18:02:58.514499
