8320000159	Babylon Soundgarden - Kombine	- Participants aged 14 and under are not admitted to the event. Participants under 18 may only enter accompanied by their parents (mother or father). However, participants who are legally under the responsibility of a guardian/custodian may enter with their legal guardian or custodian, provided that they document this status. - Participants of all ages are subject to ticketing. - Participants under 18 will be given wristbands in a different color. - Sale of alcohol and tobacco products to participants under 18 is prohibited. - Participants who exit the event area must purchase a new ticket to re-enter. - Please ensure that the wristband remains on your wrist throughout the festival. - Combined ticket holders will enter the event area on the second day using the wristband provided to them on the first day. - Pets are not allowed in the event venue. - The organizing company reserves the right to deny entry to individuals deemed inappropriate, provided that the ticket fee is refunded. - Open cigarette packs and tobacco will not be allowed in the venue. - Entry to the event area with firearms; flammable, explosive, or combustible items (*deodorants, sprays, perfumes, pepper spray, etc.); sharp, piercing, injuring objects; or any items that may be used for attack or defense, even if not intended as such (*helmets, camping chairs, selfie sticks, GoPro poles, tripods, chain accessories, etc.), as well as laser pointers, is prohibited. - The organizing company reserves the right to make any changes to the program due to unforeseen and unavoidable circumstances. - The organizing company reserves the right to change ticket prices. - Food and beverages may not be brought into the event area. - Food and beverages will be sold within the event area. - Entry with professional audio and visual equipment, video cameras, and photo cameras is prohibited. - Recording during the concert is strictly prohibited. The audience agrees that audio-visu