ould like to remind you that you are responsible for any items you bring with you to the event area. - Security personnel will subject everyone entering the event area to a security search. - No pets are allowed in the event area. Only guide dogs are permitted. - The lighting arrangements in the event area may cause temporary eye discomfort. - Event tickets must only be purchased from official sales points designated by the event organizer. The event organizer reserves the right to remove individuals from the event area if their tickets were not purchased from official sales points. - Spectators who exit the event area forfeit their rights and must purchase a new ticket to re-enter. - Event tickets are non-transferable and non-refundable. Lost tickets will not be replaced. Tickets purchased may not be used for commercial or non-commercial purposes, such as advertising, competitions, sweepstakes, promotions, etc., except for personal use, without written permission. Tickets used for such purposes will be canceled, and legal action will be taken. - The event organizer reserves the right to use photographs and videos taken of event participants in promotional materials. By participating in the event, participants agree to this right. - Care should be taken not to take photographs or videos with non-professional devices that may disturb participants and artists or violate their privacy.","description":"One of the most powerful and respected names in the international music scene, Maher Zain will meet his audience in Istanbul on September 12, 2026, at Harbiye Cemil Topuzlu Open-Air Theatre, as part of World Tour 2026. Bringing together spirituality, elegance, and the universal language of modern music through a unique artistic interpretation, Maher Zain is preparing to deliver an unforgettable night at Harbiye with his captivating vocals, strong stage presence, and a repertoire built over the years. Music lovers can expect an emotionally rich atmosphere, a distinguished live experience, and a performance that will remain in their memories. Reaching a wide audience across the world, the artist has touched millions of lives in different geographies with timeless songs such as “Insha Allah,” “Thank You Allah,” “For The Rest of My Life,” “Number One For Me,” “Mawlaya,” and many more. With songs performed in multiple languages, including Turkish, Maher Zain has built a strong bond with audiences in Türkiye over the years, transforming each concert into a special experience through the sincere and profound connection he creates on stage. With billions of streams and views across digital platforms, and music listened to in 184 countries, Maher Zain is recognized as one of the most distinctive artists of his generation thanks to his global impact. His music is not only heard, but felt, remembered, and carried across generations. At the Istanbul stop of World Tour 2026, Maher Zain will perform his classic hits as well as songs from his new album on the Harbiye stage. Surprises and special guest performances throughout the evening will make this concert one of the most remarkable events of the season. Set in the enchanting atmosphere of Harbiye, this special night is poised to become one of the most distinguished concert experiences of 2026—where music, spirituality, nostalgia, and high stage aesthetics come together.","classifications":[{"genre":{"id":"KnvZfZ7vAee","name":"R&B"},"family":false,"segment":{"id":"KZFzniwnSyZfZ7v7nJ","name":"Music"},"subGenre":{"id":"KZazBEonSMnZfZ7vkIt","name":"R&B"}}]}	2026-07-15 18:02:59.108551	2026-07-15 18:02:59.108551
