16_9.jpg", "ratio": "16_9", "width": 100, "height": 56, "fallback": true}, {"url": "https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/c/bea/03d47f66-d37b-4aca-aa17-0135be64dbea_105801_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_16_9.jpg", "ratio": "16_9", "width": 1024, "height": 576, "fallback": true}, {"url": "https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/c/bea/03d47f66-d37b-4aca-aa17-0135be64dbea_105801_TABLET_LANDSCAPE_3_2.jpg", "ratio": "3_2", "width": 1024, "height": 683, "fallback": true}, {"url": "https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/c/bea/03d47f66-d37b-4aca-aa17-0135be64dbea_105801_ARTIST_PAGE_3_2.jpg", "ratio": "3_2", "width": 305, "height": 203, "fallback": true}, {"url": "https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/c/bea/03d47f66-d37b-4aca-aa17-0135be64dbea_105801_CUSTOM.jpg", "ratio": "4_3", "width": 305, "height": 225, "fallback": true}, {"url": "https://s1.ticketm.net/dam/c/bea/03d47f66-d37b-4aca-aa17-0135be64dbea_105801_EVENT_DETAIL_PAGE_16_9.jpg", "ratio": "16_9", "width": 205, "height": 115, "fallback": true}], "locale": "en-us", "upcomingEvents": {"_total": 1, "wts-tr": 1, "_filtered": 0}, "classifications": [{"genre": {"id": "KnvZfZ7vAvE", "name": "Jazz"}, "family": false, "primary": true, "segment": {"id": "KZFzniwnSyZfZ7v7nJ", "name": "Music"}}]}]}, "nameOrigin": "custom", "pleaseNote": "- The event organiser reserves the right to refuse entry to the venue to any person deemed unsuitable or likely to disturb other guests, subject to a refund of the ticket price. - Guests must adhere to the specified seating arrangement. Guests are required to remain in their designated seats throughout the event. - We kindly request that you arrive at the event entrance with your ticket at least 30 minutes before the start time. - As a barcode/ticket check will be carried out upon entry, you must present your ticket. If your ticket was purchased via membership, please log in to your account and access your ticket via the 'My Tickets' section. If you are unable to access it, or if you did not purchase your ticket via membership, please contact Biletix Customer Services. - The organiser reserves the right to make changes to the terms and conditions for purchasing discounted tickets. - The organiser reserves the right to make changes to the venue and time of the event. - It is prohibited to bring food and drink into the event venue. - No spectators will be admitted to the venue once the event has started. - No cancellations, refunds or changes are permitted for purchased tickets. - It is prohibited to bring cameras or photographic equipment into the event venue.", "description": "Can beauty save the world? This is the wager of Bijan Chemirani, Redi Hasa and Rami Khalifé, getting together to create L'Antidote, an instrumental repertoire of rare finesse that pits the healing power of music against the poisons of the present day. A master of the percussion, who likes to immerse in jazz as well as in the Mediterranean, Bijan Chemirani combines his science of rhythm with Albanian cellist Redi Hasa, known for his contribution to the revival of traditional music in southern Italy. The other member of the trio, Lebanese pianist Rami Khalifé, masterfully blurs the boundaries between classical and electro on the keys of his piano. Bijan Chemirani summarizes the trio's chemistry with the words: “L'Antidote is an island where we can meet to play music that resembles us and brings us together beyond our individualities.” L’Antidote will take the stage at ARTER on the evening of October 4 as part of the 36th Akbank Jazz Festival, in collaboration with ARTER. Bijan Chemirani: Percussions Redi Hasa: Cello Rami Khalife: Piano", "classifications": [{"genre": {"id": "KnvZfZ7vAvE", "name": "Jazz"}, "family": false, "segment": {"id": "KZFzniwnSyZfZ7v7nJ", "name": "Music"}}]}	2026-07-15 18:02:59.108551	2026-07-15 18:02:59.108551
