venue. - Professional audio and visual equipment (such as video cameras and cameras) are not allowed. - Recording during the event is strictly prohibited. - The audience acknowledges that recording devices may be confiscated if deemed necessary by the artist management. - All attendees will be subject to security checks upon entry. - It is prohibited to bring flammable, explosive, or combustible items (such as deodorants, sprays, perfumes, cologne, etc.), as well as sharp or piercing objects, thermoses, motorcycle helmets, or laser pointers into the venue. - Pets are not allowed in the event area. - Sound and lighting systems may cause temporary hearing and visual discomfort. - Tickets must be purchased only from official sales points designated by the organizer. The organizer reserves the right to remove from the venue anyone holding tickets not purchased through official channels.", "description": "Pioneering artist of world music traditions and internationally acclaimed composer Sami Yusuf returns to Türkiye with his critically acclaimed repertoire. In these special concerts in Istanbul and Ankara, the artist brings the rich colors of world music to the stage through a contemporary and powerful musical approach. On 27 and 28 September 2026, experience Sami Yusuf’s captivating live performance at one of Istanbul’s most iconic venues, Harbiye Auditorium, Istanbul Congress Center, surrounded by the breathtaking atmosphere of the Bosphorus. On 23 and 24 September 2026, Sami Yusuf will meet music lovers in Ankara at ATO Congresium. In the capital city, known for its deep cultural heritage, the artist and his world-class orchestra will present a uniquely curated concert experience designed especially for the audience. Featuring his unforgettable and beloved compositions alongside selections from his new album Ecstasy, these concerts promise to be more than a musical event—they offer a profound artistic journey where the unifying power of music meets the spirit of the cities.", "classifications": [{"genre": {"id": "KnvZfZ7vAev", "name": "Pop"}, "family": false, "segment": {"id": "KZFzniwnSyZfZ7v7nJ", "name": "Music"}, "subGenre": {"id": "KZazBEonSMnZfZ7vk1l", "name": "Adult Contemporary"}}]}	2026-07-15 18:02:58.107361	2026-07-15 18:02:58.107361
