rough the trees to the hours stretching into the depths of the night. With carefully curated brands, culinary experiences that appeal to the senses, and encounters unique to that moment, Soundscape offers so much more than just a festival. Three Stages in the Heart of the Forest At the Main Stage, Nature Stage, and Adventure Stage, the flow of the day is shaped by the frequency of the music, the rhythm of nature, and the energy of the crowd. * Monolink * Be Svendsen * Satori (Live) * Kerala Dust * Sebastian Leger * TWO LANES (Live) * Pandhora (Live) * Julia Sandstorm * Pølaroit * Can Aydın * Claxy (Live) * Keyrah * Kitsch & SASH * Maria Nocheydia And much more coming soon... You’re invited to be part of this unique experience—where music and nature intertwine—with over 30 artists performing over two days.", "classifications": [{"genre": {"id": "KnvZfZ7vAvF", "name": "Dance/Electronic"}, "family": false, "segment": {"id": "KZFzniwnSyZfZ7v7nJ", "name": "Music"}, "subGenre": {"id": "KZazBEonSMnZfZ7vAJ1", "name": "Club Dance"}}]}	2026-07-15 18:02:58.514499	2026-07-15 18:02:58.514499
